(  GHS classification    : Not classified as hazardous under GHS criteria) Tj T*
(  Signal word           : None) Tj T*
(  Hazard statements     : None known under normal conditions of use) Tj T*
(  Precautionary stmts   : Avoid contact with eyes. Wash hands after handling.) Tj T*
