(SECTION 9. PHYSICAL AND CHEMICAL PROPERTIES) Tj T*
(  Appearance          : Colourless oily liquid) Tj T*
(  Odour               : Faint rose-like) Tj T*
(  pH \(1% solution\)    : 5.5 - 7.0) Tj T*
(  Boiling point       : 245 C) Tj T*
(  Flash point         : 121 C \(closed cup\)) Tj T*
(  Relative density    : 1.105 - 1.110 at 20 C) Tj T*
(  Solubility in water : 2.7 g / 100 ml at 20 C) Tj T*
(  Max use level       : 1.0 % \(EU Annex V / Korea safety standard\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 10. STABILITY AND REACTIVITY) Tj T*
(  Chemical stability      : Stable under recommended storage conditions.) Tj T*
(  Conditions to avoid     : Excessive heat, direct sunlight, open flame.) Tj T*
(  Incompatible materials  : Strong oxidizing agents.) Tj T*
(  Hazardous decomposition : Carbon monoxide, carbon dioxide.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 11. TOXICOLOGICAL INFORMATION) Tj T*
(  Acute oral toxicity   : LD50 \(rat\) > 2000 mg/kg) Tj T*
(  Skin irritation       : Non-irritating at use concentration) Tj T*
(  Eye irritation        : Mild irritation possible at high concentration) Tj T*
(  Sensitization         : Not a skin sensitizer) Tj T*
(  Carcinogenicity       : Not listed by IARC, NTP or OSHA) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 12. ECOLOGICAL INFORMATION) Tj T*
(  Biodegradability : Readily biodegradable) Tj T*
(  Bioaccumulation  : Not expected to bioaccumulate) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 13. DISPOSAL CONSIDERATIONS) Tj T*
(  Dispose of contents and container in accordance with local regulations.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 14. TRANSPORT INFORMATION) Tj T*
(  UN number : Not regulated as dangerous goods \(ADR / IMDG / IATA\).) Tj T*
ET
